---
---

<section
  class="py-14 md:py-16 bg-white dark:bg-[#0a0f1a] relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300"
>
  <!-- Subtle grid pattern -->
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.02] dark:opacity-[0.04]"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,255,178,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,255,178,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"
  ></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16 max-w-7xl relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <span
        class="inline-block py-1.5 px-3 bg-red-500/10 dark:bg-red-500/20 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-badge mb-4 border-l-4 border-red-500"
      >
        Riesgos al Disolver Sin Asesoría
      </span>
      <h2
        class="font-sans text-section-title font-extrabold text-constival-navy dark:text-white tracking-tight"
      >
        Lo que nadie te dice <span class="text-red-500 dark:text-red-400"
          >antes de cerrar tu empresa.</span
        >
      </h2>
      <p
        class="font-sans text-body text-constival-navy/60 dark:text-slate-400 mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto"
      >
        Disolver una empresa sin asesoría legal especializada puede derivar en responsabilidades personales de por vida para socios y representantes. Conoce los riesgos reales.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-5">
      <!-- Risk 1 -->
      <div
        class="group relative bg-gray-50 dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-6 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-red-500/30 dark:hover:border-red-400/30 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden"
      >
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-red-500 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-700"></div>
        <div class="text-red-500/10 dark:text-red-400/5 font-sans font-black text-6xl absolute -right-1 -top-2 select-none pointer-events-none">!</div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 mb-4 text-red-500 dark:text-red-400">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"
              ><path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126zM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008z"
              ></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-sans text-feature-title font-bold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-2">
            Responsabilidad <span class="text-red-500">solidaria e ilimitada</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-constival-navy/60 dark:text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed text-body">
            Si la disolución no se gestiona correctamente y aparecen deudas post-cancelación, socios y representante legal responden con su patrimonio personal de forma ilimitada y solidaria.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Risk 2 -->
      <div
        class="group relative bg-gray-50 dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-6 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-red-500/30 dark:hover:border-red-400/30 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden"
      >
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-red-500 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-700"></div>
        <div class="text-red-500/10 dark:text-red-400/5 font-sans font-black text-6xl absolute -right-1 -top-2 select-none pointer-events-none">!</div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 mb-4 text-red-500 dark:text-red-400">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"
              ><path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0113.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375H8.25m6.75 12H9.75m-1.5-3h7.5M8.25 2.25H4.875c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h14.25c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 00-9-9z"
              ></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-sans text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-2">
            Expediente <span class="text-red-500">rechazado por SUPERCIAS</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-constival-navy/60 dark:text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
            Un error en el acta de junta, en las declaraciones juradas o en la documentación habilitante y la Superintendencia devuelve el expediente completo, generando meses de retrasos y costos adicionales.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Risk 3 -->
      <div
        class="group relative bg-gray-50 dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-6 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-red-500/30 dark:hover:border-red-400/30 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden"
      >
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-red-500 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-700"></div>
        <div class="text-red-500/10 dark:text-red-400/5 font-sans font-black text-6xl absolute -right-1 -top-2 select-none pointer-events-none">!</div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 mb-4 text-red-500 dark:text-red-400">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"
              ><path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M12 6v12m-3-2.818l.879.659c1.171.879 3.07.879 4.242 0 1.172-.879 1.172-2.303 0-3.182C13.536 12.219 12.768 12 12 12c-.725 0-1.45-.22-2.003-.659-1.106-.879-1.106-2.303 0-3.182s2.9-.879 4.006 0l.415.33M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"
              ></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-sans text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-2">
            Multas y obligaciones <span class="text-red-500">que no desaparecen</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-constival-navy/60 dark:text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
            Una empresa que no cancela formalmente ante SUPERCIAS y el SRI sigue generando multas, obligaciones tributarias y responsabilidades aunque haya dejado de operar años atrás.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 text-center">
      <p class="font-serif italic text-body text-constival-teal dark:text-constival-mint/70 mb-5">
        "El cierre de una empresa mal gestionado puede perseguir a sus socios por más tiempo que la empresa misma estuvo activa."
      </p>
      <a
        href="#widget-cotizador"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-sans font-bold text-body uppercase tracking-wider text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 bg-red-500/10 hover:bg-red-500/20 px-6 py-3 md:py-3.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]"
      >
        Cerrar mi empresa con seguridad legal
        <svg
          class="w-4 h-4"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          ><path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path></svg
        >
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
